   "category" : "openxr",
   "controller_type" : "etee_controller",
   "interaction_profile" : "/interaction_profiles/valve/index_controller",
   "name" : "[ANY TRACKER] Default Pavlov VR configuration for etee Controller",
   "app_key" : "steam.app.555160",
   "description" : "Official Pavlov VR bindings for etee Controllers. Squeeze the index finger to fire/select. Curl the middle finger to grab; straighten it to release. Left trackpad moves with a 20% centre deadzone; its click supplies left stick-click. Right trackpad turns with a 35% centre deadzone. Double-tap the right lower slider to activate the weapon wheel, then use the right trackpad to select; hold the second tap if needed. Press the side thumb-finger input to send B for magazine release and contextual actions; hold it for the game's menu/back action, whose behaviour depends on game mode. Upper slider on either hand sends A. The left lower slider is unbound."
